// A named NPC commits to the first edge of its current trip by expected arrival
// in game seconds: walk to the exit, the real next departure (night cadence),
// the visible boarding queue in whole trains, the ride and the static remainder.
// The leg is re-checked at most once per brainLegRecheck and replaced only by a
// clearly earlier alternative (brainLegMargin), never once boarding is committed.
